{"id":"n61154-4-7","stage":0,"title":"불 · 火","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61154-4-7-1","ko":"민준이가 요즘 공부를 정말 열심히 하네.","zh":"敏俊最近学习可真用功啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부를","audio":"/audio/6cf72634fef36a3407ff.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"하네.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하네","audio":"/audio/49707a90866365ec2f6e.mp3"}}],"wor